   247	Fix an instance $a_1,\dots, a_n,b \in A^m$ of $\SMP(\A)$. This is also an instance of $\SMP(\A_{\M})$, and we will use this same instance in our reduction. Since we have not changed the instance, this reduction can be done in constant time.
