   249	The main goal now is to show that $b$ is in the subalgebra of $\A^m$ generated by $a_1,\dots, a_n$ if and only if $b$ is in the subalgebra of $\A_\M^m$ generated by $a_1,\dots, a_n$. To distinguish generated subalgebras of $\A^m$ and generated subalgebras of $\A_{\M}^m$, we will denote the subalgebra $\langle a_1,\dots, a_n\rangle$ of $\B \in \{\A^m,\A_{\M}^m\}$ by $\langle a_1,\dots, a_n\rangle_\B$. 
