Step 0 supports a native Track B construction: SMP over the fixed cyclic group C_127 is explicitly one of the paper’s polynomial-time regimes, so the module will expose that algorithm and measure its cost rather than claim Track A. Instances are inverse-generated Vandermonde subpower tuples whose planted term has a hidden symmetric label set.
